n|珪}}，正員外郎。{{ProperNoun|-{松}-之}}年八歳，學通{{WavyBookMark|[[論語]]}}、{{WavyBookMark|[[毛詩]]}}。博覽墳籍，立身簡素。年二十，拜殿中將軍。此官直衞左右，{{ProperNoun|晉孝武}}{{ProperNoun|太元}}中革選名家以參顧問，始用{{ProperNoun|琅邪}}{{ProperNoun|王茂之}}、{{ProperNoun|會稽}}{{ProperNoun|謝輶}}，皆南北之望。舅{{ProperNoun|庾楷}}在{{ProperNoun|江陵}}，欲得{{ProperNoun|-{松}-之}}西上，除{{ProperNoun|新野}}太守，以事難不行。拜員外散騎侍郎。{{ProperNoun|義熙}}初，爲{{ProperNoun|吳興}}{{ProperNoun|故鄣}}令，在縣有績。入爲尚書祠部郎。","raw_path":"sources/songshu/wikisource-1748217-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"裴松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"世期","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"昧","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"祖昧只原文明名，與先秦昧、公孫昧及昧蔡不同語境，不同名合。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"珪","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"父珪正員外郎；與孔珪/蔡敏兄珪/檀珪等不同姓世系，不合。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"晉孝武","kind":"person","person_id":"uke_dff_yrf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"明晉孝武太元；排除宋孝武與漢武。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"王茂之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"太元選殿中將軍之琅邪王茂之；既有晉076胡之子茂之、宋066敬弘父茂之為晉世名家，來源限定暫定同人，未據此補新官年。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"謝輶","kind":"person","person_id":"ao0_c0z_ryc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"會稽謝輶與既有宋092內史謝輶之同時地望職事相合，暫定同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"庾楷","kind":"person","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_BBB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"舅庾楷在江陵與既有晉073/099庾楷晉末江陵事件脈絡相符；舅關係本批只proposal，不擴世系。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi","book_id":"b-songshu-064","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-song064-ws1748217"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233","source":{"title":"南史/卷33","revision_id":1554233,"revision_timestamp":"2019-03-29T02:35:39Z","status":200,"response_sha256":"8380abe50572203e436afe87e646878898cffb422d117948c0f7a802b0086a5a","raw_sha256":"03f36d2b463faf43738af65819a8afae18d17df2da3a2b6e7a824a322b14dc86","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B733&oldid=1554233","api_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=query&format=json&formatversion=2&prop=revisions&rvprop=ids%7Ctimestamp%7Ccontent&rvslots=main&titles=%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B733","image_verified":false,"human_reviewed":false,"provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B733&oldid=1554233","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"03f36d2b463faf43738af65819a8afae18d17df2da3a2b6e7a824a322b14dc86","edition":null,"accessed_on":"2026-10-21","text_scope":"partial_chapter","revi